  "bio": "Ivana Belakova, a renowned tattoo artist based in Long Beach, United States, brings a unique edge to her craft with her exceptional skill level in a variety of styles including watercolor, neotraditional, and realism. Recognized internationally, she has the distinguished honor of being the only woman in the world whose tattoo art has been certified as contemporary fine art. With over 600,000 followers on Instagram, she has built a stellar reputation as a celebrity tattoo artist, further demonstrating her mastery in the field.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location: Long Beach, California, United States\n\nProfessional tattoo artist & POSITIVE LIFESTYLE BRAND \n📍LOS ANGELES\n💌 Book your appointment\nInfo@ivanatattooart.com\n📲 +1-562-472-7530",
